 $('photo-panel').querySelector('.field-note').textContent='支持 JPG、PNG、WEBP（≤5 MB）；若手机照片为 HEIC，请选择兼容格式。原图只在当前页面预览，不写入错题本。真实模型识题接通后仍需逐字核对。';
 $('home').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend','<section class="recent-box"><h3>最近的学习记录 <span class="sample-tag">合成试用</span></h3><div id="recent" class="mini-notes"></div></section>');
 $('home').insertAdjacentHTML('afterend','<section id="lesson" class="view" hidden><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">THINK FIRST, UNDERSTAND DEEPLY</span><h1>先画一画，再想一想。</h1><p>读题 → 数量关系 → 提示 → 分步讲解 → 检验 → 变式。</p></div><div id="lesson-body"></div></section><section id="knowledge" class="view" hidden><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">METHODS TO KEEP</span><h1>把方法，变成自己的。</h1><p>原创合成样题与五步模板；教材版本未核实，不映射正式章次。</p></div><div id="knowledge-list" class="card-grid"></div></section><section id="parent" class="view" hidden><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">FAMILY LEARNING OVERVIEW</span><h1>陪伴，看见每一步。</h1><p>本页为合成数据的家长视图预览；页面切换不等于家长权限隔离。</p></div><div id="parent-body"></div></section>');
